{"id":"627980","name":"柠檬鸡爪","author":"莉莉爱厨艺","authorId":"12262888","desc":"","cover":"images/627980/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡爪","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"柠檬","amount":"1颗"},{"name":"红萝卜","amount":"半个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡爪洗净，剁成小块。","img":"images/627980/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"冷水下锅，放入料酒，白醋去腥。","img":"images/627980/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入姜片去腥味。","img":"images/627980/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"中火煮约10分钟左右，用手可以轻松掐烂皮即可。","img":"images/627980/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"鸡爪出锅，过冷水。","img":"images/627980/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"红萝卜洗净，切成条。","img":"images/627980/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"柠檬切片，小米椒切圈，大蒜切碎。","img":"images/627980/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"鸡爪用盆装好。","img":"images/627980/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入准备好的配料。","img":"images/627980/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入适量醋。","img":"images/627980/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入生抽。","img":"images/627980/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入蚝油。","img":"images/627980/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"秘制剁辣椒酱。","img":"images/627980/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"拌匀，腌制两小时即可。","img":"images/627980/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"1、焯水后的鸡爪一定过冷水，皮更脆。\n2、醋可以根据自己的口味加入。\n \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}